<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33_used_specific_technique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, it relates an expression creation event to the literary constraint employed as a compositional procedure. The original property has domain crm:E7_Activity and range crm:E29_Design_or_Procedure. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation and range desmos:LiteraryConstraint."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33_used_specific_technique> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33i_was_used_by> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33_used_specific_technique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P33 used specific technique"@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33_used_specific_technique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33_used_specific_technique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E29_Design_or_Procedure> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33_used_specific_technique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS collega un evento di creazione dell'espressione alla costrizione letteraria impiegata come procedura compositiva. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E7_Activity e come range crm:E29_Design_or_Procedure. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation e come range desmos:LiteraryConstraint."@it .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33_used_specific_technique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33_used_specific_technique> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33_used_specific_technique> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P33 ha usato la tecnica specifica"@it .
